from cp23b.replay
# Branch m6-turnback-giratina-caught (docs/research/postgame.md §8): the story
# left Giratina defeated, so the Hall of Fame shows it in Turnback Cave's Giratina room. From cp23b's end (Snowpoint), set down in
# the room (the routing through the pillar rooms is sys-turnback-routing). A on Giratina: the L47 battle in
# its Altered Forme, caught with the Master Ball: FLAG_CAUGHT_GIRATINA, hidden; it joins as Altered. The portal (YES):
# set_party_giratina_form ORIGIN, the revisit room; the ghost paths of dw-turnback-room lead to the Griseous Orb,
# picked up (FLAG_OBTAINED_DISTORTION_WORLD_TURNBACK_CAVE_ROOM_GRISEOUS_ORB).
# Kept setup: the warp into the Giratina room (the pillar rooms are off the chain; sys-turnback-routing).
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM 11 15 up
until idle 6000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM_GIRATINA false
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_GIRATINA false
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
battle catch platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 20000
+0 assert battle scripted platinum:SPECIES_GIRATINA caught
advance text 20000
until idle 3000
